---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Tifton Fitness"
  description="How Tifton Fitness collects and uses data from visitors to this website."
>
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-prose">

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: April 26, 2026</p>

      <p>
        This policy explains what information is collected when you visit tiftonfitness.com
        and how it is used. We do not sell your data.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics — Google Analytics 4</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how visitors use this site — which pages
        are viewed, how long visits last, and how people arrive. GA4 sets cookies on your device
        to track this activity across sessions.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>We only activate analytics if you accept cookies.</strong> If you decline or ignore
        the cookie banner, no analytics data is collected.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google may process analytics data on servers in the United States.
        See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>
        for details on how they handle this data.
      </p>

      <h2>Fonts — Google Fonts</h2>
      <p>
        This site loads fonts (Fraunces and Inter Tight) from Google Fonts. When your browser
        requests a font file, Google receives your IP address. No cookie is set by this request.
        See <a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy" rel="noopener">Google Fonts privacy FAQ</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Form — Formspree</h2>
      <p>
        The contact form on this site submits to <a href="https://formspree.io" rel="noopener">Formspree</a>,
        a third-party form service. When you submit the form, Formspree receives your name,
        phone number, email address (if provided), and message. Formspree forwards this to us
        by email and stores a copy in their system.
      </p>
      <p>
        We use submitted information only to respond to your inquiry. We do not add you to
        any mailing list without your explicit request.
        See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" rel="noopener">Formspree's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Maps — Google Maps</h2>
      <p>
        The gym page includes an embedded Google Maps iframe showing our location.
        Loading the map sends a request to Google, which may set cookies and collect your
        IP address. If you have a Google account, this may be associated with it.
        See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Membership Signup — GloFox</h2>
      <p>
        The membership page embeds the GloFox portal, a third-party gym management platform.
        If you sign up for a membership, GloFox collects your name, contact details,
        and payment information. We do not process or store payment information ourselves.
        See <a href="https://www.glofox.com/privacy-policy/" rel="noopener">GloFox's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets one first-party cookie preference key (<code>tf_consent</code>) in your
        browser's local storage to remember your cookie consent decision. No other cookies
        are set by this site directly. Third-party services (GA4, Google Maps) may set their
        own cookies if you accept analytics.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can decline analytics at any time by clicking "Decline" on the cookie banner,
        or by clearing your browser's local storage for this site. If you submitted a contact
        form and want your information removed from Formspree's records, contact us and we
        will request deletion on your behalf.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Reach us at:
      </p>
      <address>
        Tifton Fitness<br />
        130 Hunt Rd B7, Tifton, GA 31793<br />
        <a href="tel:+12293406228">(229) 340-6228</a>
      </address>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-400);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  p, address {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    background: var(--color-gray-50);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  address {
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
